                    Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 861, For
                    the President’s File, Vietnam Negotiations, Camp David
                    Memoranda, 1969–1970. Secret; Nodis; Eyes
                    Only. The memorandum is an uninitialed copy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d14-f2" n="2" xml:id="d14-f2-content">
                <p>Frenchman Jean Sainteny, former French
                    Government official with extensive official experience in Indochina. Nixon describes and quotes from these messages
                    in <hi rendition="#italic">
                        RN: The Memoirs of Richard Nixon</hi>, pp. 349–350.</p>
            </note>
